            0.881
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_18_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{aligned}12\\; mm  &= 10\\; mm  + 2\\; mm  \\\\&= 1\\; cm  + \\frac{2}{10}\\; cm  \\\\&= 1.2\\; cm .\\end{aligned}"
